<http://data.silknow.org/object/6f49b3c5-979d-39a6-8819-7e20eb1bae9c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Part of an embroidered fabric, possibly a garment, probably cut from a larger piece, and mounted on crimson silk fabric. The surface is covered with couched embroidery in flattened gold wire and gold-wrapped thread, and seed pearls, with added red and silver spangles. The design consists of five bands of flowers above a row of large buta, all surrounded by a band of scrolling flowers."@en , "The complete piece may have been intended for use as a garment, clothing."@en , "Textile, possibly part of a waistband, silk with gold wire, gold-wrapped thread and pearl couching, Triplicane, ca. 1855-1879"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/851542be-42d0-3289-82dd-c58b46e4ee92> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/7ed73f66-96a7-3a98-b143-06bfca29892b> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b56ca915-c933-3cc9-b55c-730802ae7210> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "The complete piece may have been intended for use as a garment, clothing."@en , "Textile, possibly part of a waistband, silk with gold wire, gold-wrapped thread and pearl couching, Triplicane, ca. 1855-1879"@en , "Part of an embroidered fabric, possibly a garment, probably cut from a larger piece, and mounted on crimson silk fabric. The surface is covered with couched embroidery in flattened gold wire and gold-wrapped thread, and seed pearls, with added red and silver spangles. The design consists of five bands of flowers above a row of large buta, all surrounded by a band of scrolling flowers."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/6f49b3c5-979d-39a6-8819-7e20eb1bae9c/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/6f49b3c5-979d-39a6-8819-7e20eb1bae9c/dimension/2> ;
